	(text "404 V / 6k = 67.3 mA initial; 27.2 W total (5.44 W per resistor).\n320 uF: 404 V to 60 V in 3.66 s nominal.\n+20% capacitance and +1% resistance: 4.44 s, excluding system delays.\n280 uF and 320 uF are alternatives; not simultaneous loads."
